  mods/md-menu          from Herdr's `menu` 0.1.10, with the Markdown renderer merged in from
                        ohneda/herdr-markdown-browser (MIT; notice below) — changed: main.js,
                        mod.json; added: marks.js, open.js, LICENSE-upstream
  mods/auto-tabs        from Herdr's shipped `tabs` (the app's copy, 2026-11-01) — changed: main.js,
                        mod.json; added: names.js
